#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#462 (mes)
- "The Shaman's dead now. Who was that Shaman really?"
+ "O Xamã está morto. Quem era aquele Xamã, afinal?"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#463 (mes)
- "Kruger seemed to be relieved as he hears of the death of the Shaman, but you notice the bitter expression on his face."
+ "Kruger parece aliviado ao saber da morte do Xamã, mas você nota a amargura no rosto dele."
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#464 (mes)
- "[Kruger]"
+ "[Kruger]"
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#465 (mes)
- "I.. I just couldn't kill my own daughter..."
+ "Eu.. eu simplesmente não consegui matar a minha própria filha..."
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#466 (mes)
- "Thank you, I'm sure she's finally free from the nightmare that used to choke her soul."
+ "Obrigado. Tenho certeza de que ela enfim se livrou do pesadelo que sufocava a alma dela."
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#467 (mes)
- "Kruger was about to say something more, but he breathed his last breath before he could..."
+ "Kruger ia dizer mais alguma coisa, mas deu o último suspiro antes..."
#: npc/instances/OrcsMemory.txt#468 (mes)
- "You can see the dead body of Kruger, peacefully lying on the ground."
+ "Você vê o corpo de Kruger, caído no chão em paz."
